        "notes": "Addon Adder 1.26: the imps settle anywhere. Every helper imp can now be woken on open ground -- use a dormant imp on the top of any solid block and that spot becomes the centre of his work area, which grows from 21-by-21 to 31-by-31. Every imp visibly works now: Cinder scoops and throws, Sprout bends to chop and plant, Bubble stirs with both arms, Ledger shuffles through his pages, Porter hauls with both arms up, Lumen holds his light high, Shepherd snips, and Fisher casts, waits on his bobber, and reels in the fish you watched swim in. Cinder's inventory icon is redrawn to match the rest of the family. Porter counts a double chest as one chest (his take-it-out-and-put-it-back loop is fixed), sorts your storage by the signs on your chests, and when no chest wears a sign he runs his own tidy auto-sort instead. Fisher takes better rods now -- hand him any of Better Fishing's five rods, or an enchanted vanilla rod, and he fishes with it for real; pick him up and he hands it back. Eighteen add-ons built in in all.",
